    "en": "Fantasy World Manager is the ultimate, gamified tool for creating, simulating, and observing living fantasy worlds. Build a fantasy world on a massive scale ...and watch it come to life! Create unique places! ...where heroes go on adventures! ...and fight epic battles! ..to seize control! Use a variety of editors to shape the world according to your rules! ...and much more!"
